# build output
dist/

# Regenerated from src/data/*.json by prebuild on every build, and embeds a
# "Last generated" date plus the live event list. A committed copy is stale as
# soon as the 6-hourly calendar cron runs, so tracking it only misleads anyone
# reading it on GitHub. Nothing depends on the checked-in file.
public/llms.txt

